  "question": {
    "text": "If frequency of electromagnetic wave is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo> </mo><mi>MHz</mi></math> and it travels in air along <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math> direction then the corresponding electric and magnetic field vectors will be mutually perpendicular to each other and the wavelength of the wave <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>in</mi><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is :",
